       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.          CRSPRT2.
       AUTHOR.              JEFF BUNGO.
       DATE-WRITTEN.        MAY 28, 1996.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.
      *     THIS PROGRAM DOES THE ACTUAL PRINTING OF A RECEIVING SLIP.
      *     WITHOUT THE SPECIAL EXPANDED AND COMPRESSED CHARACTERS.
      *
      *     THIS PROGRAM WAS COPIED FROM CRSPRT PROGRAM.
      *     ANY CHANGES MADE TO THIS PROGRAM SHOULD BE MADE
      *     IN CRSPRT AND ANY CHANGES MADE TO THAT PROGRAM
      *     SHOULD ALSO BE MADE HERE.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                      C R S P R T                        **
      **                                                         **
      *D    THIS PROGRAM RETRIEVES THE DATA FOR A RECEIVING SLIP **
      *D    NUMBER FROM THE DATABASE AND PRINTS IT TO THE        **
      *D    PRINTERS FOUND IN THE SPOOLFILE FILE FOR THAT USER.  **
      **                                                         **
      **    THERE ARE SOME DIFFERENCES BETWEEN THE RECEIVING     **
      **    SLIP PRINTED FROM A REPRINT REQUEST AND THE          **
      **    RECEIVING SLIP PRINTED AT CREATION TIME.             **
      **          1.  NO RECEIVED UM IS PRINTED ON REPRINT.      **
      **              (NOT STORED IN DATABASE)                   **
      **          2.  NO FREIGHT COMMENT FIELD IS PRINTED        **
      **              ON REPRINT. (NOT STORED IN DATABASE)       **
      **          #2 NO LONGER APPLIES WITH RLSE H0100 (JSB)     **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **   CALLING ROUTINES:                                     **
      **          1.  SRSPRTS  - RECEIVING SLIP REPRINT          **
      **          2.  SRCVEXEC - RECEIVER CREATE PROGRAM        **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      *   PASSED PARAMETERS:   (NOT INCLUSIVE OR IN ORDER)        *
      *     1.  BASE   X(10)                                      *
      *                DATABASE NAME (STORES)                     *
      *                                                           *
      *     3.  PASS-PGM-NAME   X(8)                              *
      *                PASSED SO BLOWUP PROGRAM CAN SHOW THE      *
      *                CALLING PROGRAM NAME.                      *
      *                                                           *
      *     4.  PASS-PRINT-DEPT X(4)                              *
      *                AKRON ONLY - EACH SIGNON DOCK HAS ITS OWN  *
      *                PRINT DEPARTMENT.                          *
      *                                                           *
      *     5.  MISC-FRT-COMMENT    X(68)                             *
      *                OSD COMMENT FROM FREIGHT SCREEN NEEDS TO   *
      *                BE PASSED BECAUSE ITS NOT STORED IN DB.    *
      *                                                           *
      *     6.  MISC-RS-ARG          X(14)                             *
      *                RECEIVING SLIP NUMBER TO BE PRINTED        *
      *                                                           *
      *     7.  SPOOL-PRT-NO    S9(2) COMP                        *
      *         ACCTG-PRT-NO    S9(2) COMP                        *
      *         PRINT-PRT-NO    S9(2) COMP                        *
      *                SPOOLED PRINTER NUMBERS FOR PRINT OUT.     *
      *                SPOOL-PRT-NO IS REQUIRED, OTHERS AREN'T.   *
      *                                                           *
      *     8.  PLT-NUMBER    X(3)                              *
      *                PLANT NUMBER FOR SPECIAL LOGICS.           *
      *                                                           *
      *     9.  PRINT-PRICE-SW  X(1)                            *
      *                "Y" IF AKRON'S CORDER PO HAS A DIFFERENT   *
      *                PRICE UM FROM ORDERED UM. NEED TO PRINT    *
      *                PRICE UM IN THAT CASE.                     *
      *                                                           *
      *    10.  PASS-ITEM-TABLE.           OCCURS 12 TIMES.       *
      *           A)  PASS-ITEM      - ITEM NUMBER ON RCVING SLIP *
      *           B)  PASS-DLV-UM    - CODED DELIVERED UM         *
      *           C)  PASS-PRICE-QTY -                            *
      *           D)  PASS-PRICE-UM  - CERTAIN RECEIVING DEPTS    *
      *                                NEED TO SHOW UNIT PRICES.  *
      *         THE ABOVE TABLE IS ONLY FILLED IN WHEN CREATING   *
      *         A RECEIVIER, NOT WHEN PROCESSING A REPRINT.       *
      *                                                           *
      *    11.  VIEW-COMAREA - SO BLOWUP PROGRAM CAN ABORT        *
      *                                                           *
      *    12.  BASE-MMISA X(24)                                  *
      *                DATABASE NAME (MMISA)                      *
      *************************************************************
      *C***********************************************************
      *C 06/06/96    JEFF BUNGO
      *C     EXPANDED DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C     RECOMPILED TO PICK UP NEW DATE FORMATS.
      *C
      *C 10/31/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ADDED PRINTING OF RECEIVING INSTRUCTIONS FOR BEFORE
      *C   AND AFTER ALL ITEMS AS WELL AS ITEM INSTRUCTIONS.
      *C
      *C 05/22/97  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   ADDED "END OF RECEIVER" PRINT TEXT AT THE END OF
      *C   THE RECEIVING SLIP PRINT.
      *C
      *C 01/26/99  CA YODER
      *C   IF A NON-CODED RCVG SLIP WAS PRINTED AFTER ONE WITH
      *C   CODED ITEMS WHICH INCLUDES CHAT NUMBERS, THE CHAT
      *C   DESCRIPTION WAS CARRIED OVER TO THE NEXT RCVG SLIP.
      *C   CORRECTED LOGIC TO ELIMINATE THE PRINTING ERROR.
      *C
      *C 03/24/98  JIM COFFMAN
      *C   ADD CIRA AND CIRO TO LIST OF RECEIVING
      *C   DEPARTMENTS TO PRINT PRICE INFORMATION.
      *C
      *C 12/06/00  CA YODER
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO CHECK ORIGINATOR FIELD ON PRT-REQ-LINE
      *C   TO SEE IF LINE SHOULD BE PRINTED.
      *C
      *C 03/14/02  CA YODER        (NAPANEE REQUEST)
      *C   ADDED LOGIC TO PRINT COMMENTS FROM MCFPCS7000 ON RECEIVING
      *C   SLIP, IF THE FILE EXISTS.
      *C
      *C 01/28/2002  DAN RAUCH     DCR01
      *C   CORRECT PRINTING OF "NOTIFY"  - INIT BUF-MREQ PRIOR READ
      *C
      *C 02/21/2006  CA YODER    REQ #2006-4006237-0001
      *C   ADDED FOUR EXPEDITOR DEPARTMENTS (EXCA, EXCO, EXMA, AND
      *C   EXMO) TO LIST OF DEPARTMENTS WHERE PRICE IS DISPLAYED
      *C   ON RECEIVING SLIP.
      *C
      *C***********************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. C01 IS NEW-PAGE.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
            SELECT ONLINE-PRT   ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT.
            SELECT ACCTG-PRT    ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT2.
            SELECT THIRD-PRT    ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT3.
            SELECT CAPITAL-PRT  ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT4.
            SELECT RAWMAT-PRT   ASSIGN TO PRINTER-MCPRT5.
            SELECT HOLD-PRT     ASSIGN TO DISK-RCHLDPRT
                              ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
                              ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
                              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DVENDOR
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DVENDITM
              ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0802
              ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
              RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
              FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
            SELECT DPOFREIGHT
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2401
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DPOITEM
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DRCVITEM
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT MSTORERM
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0201
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DPODATAITM
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT MPORCV
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0101
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DREQD
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2102
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT MREQ
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS2001
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DPORECD
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0901
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT PER-PERSONNEL
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DCHATNO
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS5502
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
             SELECT DCOMMENT
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1901
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.

       FD  ONLINE-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS PRINT-RCD.
       01  PRINT-RCD.
           05  PLINE           PIC X(80).

       FD  ACCTG-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS ACCTG-RCD.
       01  ACCTG-RCD.
           05  PACCTG          PIC X(80).

       FD  THIRD-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS THIRD-RCD.
       01  THIRD-RCD.
           05  PTHIRD               PIC X(80).

       FD  CAPITAL-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS CAPITAL-RCD.
       01  CAPITAL-RCD.
           05  PCAP                   PIC X(80).

       FD  RAWMAT-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 80 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS RAWMAT-RCD.
       01  RAWMAT-RCD.
           05  RMAT                   PIC X(80).

       FD  HOLD-PRT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
           RECORD CONTAINS 84 CHARACTERS
           DATA RECORD IS HOLD-PRT-RCD.
       01  HOLD-PRT-RCD.
           05  HOLD-PRT-ITEM.
               10  HOLD-PRT-ITM     PIC 9(4).
           05  HOLD-PRT-DESC        PIC X(80).
       FD  DVENDOR
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDOR-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0700  OF MCFLCS0701.

       FD  DVENDITM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDITM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0800  OF MCFLCS0802.

       FD  DPOFREIGHT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOFREIGHT-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS2400  OF MCFLCS2401.

       FD  DPOITEM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOITEM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1000  OF MCFLCS1002.

       FD  DRCVITEM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DRCVITEM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1200  OF MCFLCS1201.

       FD  MSTORERM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MSTORERM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0200  OF MCFLCS0201.

       FD  DPODATAITM
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPODATAITM-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1100  OF MCFLCS1101.

       FD  MPORCV
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPORCV-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0100  OF MCFLCS0101.

       FD  DREQD
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DREQD-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS2100  OF MCFLCS2102.

       FD  MREQ
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MREQ-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS2000  OF MCFLCS2001.

       FD  DPORECD
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPORECD-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0900  OF MCFLCS0901.

       FD  PER-PERSONNEL
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  PER-PERSONNEL-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPMM0300 OF MCFLMM0301.

       FD  DCHATNO
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DCHATNO-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS5500 OF MCFLCS5502.

       FD  DCOMMENT
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DCOMMENT-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1900 OF MCFLCS1901.

      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      *              WORKING STORAGE SECTION                      *
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  SUB                        PIC 9(2)  VALUE 0.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1          PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2          PIC X.
       01  TALLY-MSG-WS               PIC X(8)    VALUE SPACES.
       01  LOT-MSG-WS                 PIC X(8)   VALUE SPACES.
       01  LINE-ADV                   PIC 99     VALUE ZEROS.
       01  LINE-CTR                   PIC 9(4)   VALUE ZEROS.
       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER             PIC X(76)  VALUE SPACES.
       01  VEN-LIT-SAVE               PIC X(13)  VALUE SPACES.
       01  BUYER-LIT-SAVE             PIC X(6)   VALUE SPACES.
       01  SELLER-LIT-SAVE            PIC X(13)  VALUE SPACES.
       01  PRICE-QTY-SAVE             PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
       01  SAVE-PACK-SLIP             PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
       01  PRINT-DCOMPL-SW            PIC X      VALUE "N".
      *----------  REQUISITION NUMBER FROM PO HEADER IN CASE THE
      *            INDIVIDUAL ITEMS DON'T HAVE A REQUISITION NUMBER
       01  SAVE-REQ                      PIC X(12) VALUE SPACES.

      *----------  ONLY PRINT THE LAST 5 CHARACTERS OF ZBILL
       01  WS-ENTIRE-ZBILL.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X     VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-ZBILL                  PIC X(5)  VALUE SPACES.

      *----------  SUBSCRIPT INTO COUNT TABLE
       01  I                          PIC 9(4)    VALUE ZERO.
      *----------  PRINT POSITION OF 6 STOREROOM LOCATIONS
       01  STK                        PIC 9      VALUE ZERO.
      *----------  SUBSCRIPT INTO DESCRIPTION TABLE
       01  X                          PIC 9(2)   VALUE ZERO.

      *-----------  IF RECEIVER WAS NOT CREATED, DO NOT PRINT
       01  DO-NOTHING                    PIC 9    VALUE ZERO.
           88  NO-RECEIVER                        VALUE 1.

      *----------  RECEIVE INSTRUCTION NUMBERS
       01  RCV-INSTRUCTIONS.
           05  RCV-BEFORE-INST.
               10  RCV-BEFORE-NO OCCURS 6 TIMES PIC X(3).
           05  RCV-AFTER-INST.
               10  RCV-AFTER-NO OCCURS 6 TIMES PIC X(3).
       01  FILLER REDEFINES RCV-INSTRUCTIONS.
           05  RCV-INST-NO OCCURS 12 TIMES PIC X(3).
       01  RECEIVE-INSTRUCTION      PIC X(3).
       01  BUILD-COMMENT-NO.
           05  BUILD-COM-PREFIX     PIC X     VALUE "R".
           05  BUILD-COM-NO         PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.

       COPY DBPOARG1 OF COPYLIB.
       COPY DBPOARG2 OF COPYLIB.
       01  PO-RLSE-RS-WORKAREA.
           05  DISPLAY-PO-RLSE-RS.
               10  DISP-PO            PIC X(7)   VALUE SPACES.
               10  FILLER             PIC X      VALUE "-".
               10  DISP-RLSE          PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
               10  FILLER             PIC X      VALUE "-".
               10  DISP-RS            PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
           05  DISPLAY-FRT-REFER.
               10  DISP-FRT-PO        PIC X(7)   VALUE SPACES.
               10  HYPHEN-1           PIC X      VALUE "-".
               10  DISP-FRT-RLSE      PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.
               10  HYPHEN-2           PIC X      VALUE "-".
               10  DISP-FRT-RS        PIC X(3)   VALUE SPACES.

      *----------  QUANTITY WORK AREA
       01  WORK-QTY-X.
           05  WORK-QTY-BDP-X         PIC X(8).
           05  WORK-QTY-ADP-X         PIC X(4).
       01  WORK-QTY REDEFINES WORK-QTY-X     PIC 9(8)V9(4).

      *----------  CURRENT DELIVERED QTY SAVED FOR NONCODED KELLY RAW
      *            MATERIALS TO MULTIPLY WITH CONVERSION FACTOR.
       01  SAVE-QTY                   PIC 9(8)V9(4).

      *----------  USED TO CONVERT NON-KELLY QUANTITIES FROM
      *            PO TO STOREROOM UM
       01  WS-CONVERT-FLD                    PIC 9(8)V9(4).

      *----------  COMPARES RECEIVER ITEM WITH ITEM IN DESCRIPTION
      *            HOLD FILE
       01  HOLD-ITM-NO                PIC 9(4)    VALUE ZEROES.

       COPY PLANTS OF COPYLIB.
      **************************************************************
