       COPY ESCNAME OF COPYLIB.
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************'
      *                   MAIN PARAGRAGH                          *
      *     RETRIEVE HEADER AND FREIGHT INFORMATION FOR RECEIVER  *
      *     AND THEN DETERMINE IF  RECEIVER IS CODED OR NONCODED. *
      *     READ THROUGH EACH RECEIVER'S ITEMS TO DETERMINE HOW   *
      *     MANY PAGES THE PRINTOUT WILL BE, AND THEN START OVER  *
      *     AND PRINT THE SECOND TIME THROUGH THE ITEMS.          *
      *                                                           *
      *     RECEIVING SLIP REPRINT WILL NOT HAVE FREIGHT OSD      *
      *     COMMENTS PRINTED OR HAVE CODED RECEIVING UM PRINTED.  *
      *     THESE ITEMS ARE NOT STORED IN THE DATABASE.  THEY     *
      *     ARE PASSED PARAMETERS WHEN A RECEIVER IS CREATED.     *
      *     IF AKRON AND IF A C-ORDER HAS A DIFFERENT ORDERED UM  *
      *     FROM THE DELIVERED UM, THE PRICE DATA IS PASSED       *
      *     WHEN A RECEIVER IS CREATED, BUT NOT FOR A REPRINT.    *
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE-MMISA MISCELLANEOUS-DATA
                          RCVR-PRINT-PARAMETERS RCVR-PRINT-ITEMS
                          VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS, COUNT-AREA,
                          ESC-NAME.
       00-PRINT SECTION 00.
       00-SRSPRT-MAIN.
           MOVE ZEROES TO PG-NO.
           MOVE SPACES TO DISP-FRT-PO, DISP-FRT-RLSE, DISP-FRT-RS.
           IF MISC-REPRINT = "Y"
              MOVE "R C V  S L I P  R E P R I N T"  TO HDR1-TITLE
           ELSE
              MOVE "  R E C E I V I N G  S L I P  " TO HDR1-TITLE.

      *----------  READ IN LITERALS FOR RECEIVING SLIP
           MOVE 64               TO LANG-SETNUM.
           MOVE 1                TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG1.
           MOVE 2                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG3.
           MOVE 4                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG4.
           MOVE 5                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG5.
           MOVE 6                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG6.
           MOVE 7                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG7.
           MOVE 8                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG8.
           MOVE 9                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG9.
           MOVE 10                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG10.
           MOVE 11                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG11.
           MOVE 12                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG12.
           MOVE 13                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG13.
           MOVE 14                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG14.
           MOVE 15                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG15.
           MOVE 16                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG16.
           MOVE 17                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO  MSG17 PRT-COMM1.
           MOVE 18                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER              TO MSG18.
