           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER               TO MSG42.
           IF MISC-REPRINT = "Y"
              MOVE 41                           TO LANG-MSGNUM
           ELSE
              MOVE 42                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER                           TO HDR1-TITLE.
           MOVE 43                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER               TO VEN-LIT-SAVE.
           MOVE 44                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER               TO BUYER-LIT-SAVE.
           MOVE 45                           TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
